        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/340182d62d320fe61464277afd2581a6.avif?t=1761922011\" width=1160 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in a fantastical world where the oceans have been transformed into vast living forests, Shuvani must journey through one of them to protect her family, facing all kinds of amalgam creatures along the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to defeat the waves of enemies, you'll unlock new and powerful abilities to use in the next battle before venturing into the next room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FATE OF SHUVANI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of your skills and defeat all the enemies that stand in your way, as you’ll only have one chance to reach the heart of the forest and carry out your revenge. As you overcome the challenges of this ever-changing hostile environment, you’ll have the opportunity to add new powers to your skillset, allowing you to overcome the overwhelming strength of your enemies with your own strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/ee4d305d6d9e63352c9dbc625fc92e3d.poster.avif?t=1761922011\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/ee4d305d6d9e63352c9dbc625fc92e3d.webm?t=1761922011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/ee4d305d6d9e63352c9dbc625fc92e3d.mp4?t=1761922011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 distinct types of magic: Arcane, Astral, Totemic, Spectral, and Hemomancy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipable artifacts with powerful passive effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be creative!</strong> Mix and match different magics and abilities to create devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various playstyles and develop effective strategies to suit your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With scalable difficulty and an epic final battle, your choices will shape the path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/b6a2ff17948cae6842e3ec437acc3997.poster.avif?t=1761922011\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/b6a2ff17948cae6842e3ec437acc3997.webm?t=1761922011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/b6a2ff17948cae6842e3ec437acc3997.mp4?t=1761922011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEEK THE RELIC AND BREAK THE CYCLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down and confront the creature that stole your only way out of the forest. Uncover the reason behind its attack and unveil a terrifying final plan.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/340182d62d320fe61464277afd2581a6.avif?t=1761922011\" width=1160 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in a fantastical world where the oceans have been transformed into vast living forests, Shuvani must journey through one of them to protect her family, facing all kinds of amalgam creatures along the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to defeat the waves of enemies, you'll unlock new and powerful abilities to use in the next battle before venturing into the next room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FATE OF SHUVANI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of your skills and defeat all the enemies that stand in your way, as you’ll only have one chance to reach the heart of the forest and carry out your revenge. As you overcome the challenges of this ever-changing hostile environment, you’ll have the opportunity to add new powers to your skillset, allowing you to overcome the overwhelming strength of your enemies with your own strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/ee4d305d6d9e63352c9dbc625fc92e3d.poster.avif?t=1761922011\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/ee4d305d6d9e63352c9dbc625fc92e3d.webm?t=1761922011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/ee4d305d6d9e63352c9dbc625fc92e3d.mp4?t=1761922011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 distinct types of magic: Arcane, Astral, Totemic, Spectral, and Hemomancy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipable artifacts with powerful passive effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be creative!</strong> Mix and match different magics and abilities to create devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various playstyles and develop effective strategies to suit your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With scalable difficulty and an epic final battle, your choices will shape the path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/b6a2ff17948cae6842e3ec437acc3997.poster.avif?t=1761922011\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/b6a2ff17948cae6842e3ec437acc3997.webm?t=1761922011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877290/extras/b6a2ff17948cae6842e3ec437acc3997.mp4?t=1761922011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEEK THE RELIC AND BREAK THE CYCLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down and confront the creature that stole your only way out of the forest. Uncover the reason behind its attack and unveil a terrifying final plan.</p>",
